<!--
  Hardened-runtime entitlements for the notarized macOS build. Intentionally
  empty: music-player only plays audio (no microphone, no network, no child
  processes) and is a self-contained statically linked binary, so it needs none
  of the hardened-runtime exceptions. The hardened runtime itself is turned on by
  `rcodesign sign --code-signature-flags runtime`, not by this file.

  Add an entitlement here ONLY if a notarized run fails for lack of one (for
  example `com.apple.security.cs.disable-library-validation` if the app ever
  dlopen's an unsigned third-party dylib). Keep the set as small as possible:
  notarization scans for over-broad entitlements.
-->
